DESCRIPTION:[Podcast: This Week in Virology]\n\nIn his weekly clinical upd
 ate\, Daniel Griffin and Vincent Racaniello are crestfallen to learn of th
 e 6 th measles death in Pennsylvania and more than 9000 deaths from Ebola
 \, an enterovirus/Coxsackievirus outbreak at the University of Pennsylvani
 a\, decimation of the HIV services following withdrawal of PEPFAR and USAI
 D\, role of gut microbes in vaccine adverse events such as fever\, continu
 ed raw milk consumption\, and thermostable nanoparticles for mRNA vaccine 
 delivery before Dr. Griffin deep dives into recent statistics RSV\, influe
 nza\, SARS-CoV-2 infections\, measles\, development of a rapid diagnostic 
 for measles\, how long COVID effects sleep cycles and the microbiome\, and
  contacting your federal government representative to stop the assault on 
 science and biomedical research. Click arrow to play Download TWiV 1366 (3
 7 MB .mp3\, 62 min) Subscribe (free): Apple Podcasts \, RSS \, email Becom
