 n) HIV service delivery after the PEPFAR and USAID HIV funding withdrawal 
 in Uganda and Zimbabwe: an interrupted time-series study (LANCET: Global H
 ealth) The human gut microbiome primes fever after vaccination (Science) E
 scape to 11\,100’ in Rustic Luxury (HaydenBackcountry) Consumption of Un
 pasteurized (Raw) Milk and Milk Products by Pregnant People and Children: 
